          "id": "339b0d37-90c9-43de-8940-c8cd636afe59",
          "memory": "On the morning of October 2, 2026, Ben lost his blue keyring with his house key, thinking it was on the kitchen counter. After checking the bowl by the door, backpack, couch cushions, bathroom counter, and laundry, he found it in the pocket of his grey coat worn on the chilly October 1 morning, saving a hardware store trip to re-cut the key.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "9576ec2f-f77c-4c63-91e7-7c3e0bffab2a",
          "memory": "User ran a load of darks laundry on October 1, 2026 and noticed nothing jingling, but said the dryer made a thumping noise again. Ben commented the dryer is on its last legs.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "63f7d913-0fca-4ca6-8b96-7e05fec620c7",
          "memory": "On October 2, 2026, User and Ben's coffee maker sputtered for a long time. User refilled the water and suggested it needs descaling again.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "8deeaef3-ea62-4ba8-ad47-86251e86b190",
          "memory": "User once found their phone in the fridge, shared on October 2, 2026 when Ben said he does dumb stuff when half awake while hunting for his keyring.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "26e383c8-bfa9-448c-9cc9-55aee8541dd2",
          "memory": "As of October 2, 2026, Ben still needed to send an email to his landlord and said he was doing it now before forgetting again.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "6409b0a7-b12a-487b-a043-f6151fbcd311",
          "memory": "As of October 2, 2026, User needed to finally sort a large recycling pile that Ben called a mountain.",
